Origin: EmberBSD (AI-assisted); not submitted upstream.
GCC 16.2.0 with Iain Sandoe's Darwin port and the pkgsrc patches.
Add an explicit AArch64 Darwin LLVM MC command language. Keep collect2,
LTO, libraries, start files and constructors. This is a default-CPU pilot.
Other assembler modes and targets keep their current defaults.
GCC source retains its GPLv3+ licence and upstream copyright notices.

